{"created": "2023-04-12T12:56:19.893525+00:00", "modified": "2023-10-30T12:41:57.407562+00:00", "id": 7821694, "conceptrecid": "7821693", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7821694", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.7821693", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7821694", "metadata": {"title": "Numerical dataset belonging to: 'A numerical benchmark for modelling phase change in molten salt reactors'", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7821694", "publication_date": "2023-04-12", "description": "<p>This folder contains the numerical data belonging to the paper 'A numerical benchmark for modelling phase change in molten salt reactors' (Mateusz Pater, Bouke Kaaks, Bent Lauritzen, Danny Lathouwers), published in Annals of Nuclear Energy in 2023 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.anucene.2023.110093\">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.anucene.2023.110093</a>). Please cite this paper when publishing work referring to or including (part of) this data set. The data set includes all raw simulation data, including the extracted&nbsp; melt fronts and temperature and velocity profiles used for generating the figures in the paper. The format of the data generated with OpenFOAM and Star CCM+ is .csv, which can be opened by excel, a text editor or another suitable data reader. The format of the data generated by DGFlows is .msh for the raw simulation output and .pos for the extracted profiles, both of which may be opened by GMSH (the open source mesh generator and postprocessing tool for FEM simulations), or a text editor.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Pater, Mateusz", "affiliation": "Technical University of Denmark"}, {"name": "Kaaks, Bouke", "affiliation": "Delft University of Technology"}, {"name": "Lauritzen, Bent", "affiliation": "Technical University of Denmark"}, {"name": "Lathouwers, Danny", "affiliation": "Delft University of Technology"}], "keywords": ["phase change", "melting", "molten salt reactor", "benchmark", "freeze valve"], "resource_type": {"title": "Data paper", "type": "publication", "subtype": "datapaper"}, "journal": {"issue": "110093", "title": "Annals of Nuclear Energy", "volume": "194"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "847527", "internal_id": "10.13039/501100000780::847527", "funder": {"name": "European Commission", "doi": "10.13039/501100000780", "acronym": "EC"}, "title": "Severe Accident Modeling and Safety Assessment for Fluid-fuel Energy Reactors", "acronym": "SAMOSAFER", "program": "H2020-Euratom", "url": "https://cordis.europa.eu/projects/847527"}], "communities": [{"id": "eu"}, {"id": "samosafer"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "7821693"}}]}}, "title": "Numerical dataset belonging to: 'A numerical benchmark for modelling phase change in molten salt reactors'", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7821694", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7821694", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7821694?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7821694", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7821694", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.7821694", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7821694/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7821693", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7821693", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7821693", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.7821693", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:7821694/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:7821694/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7821694/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7821694/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7821694/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7821694/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7821694/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7821694/draft", "ac